/// For the My Skills report (FR-EMP-08, AC-10).
///
/// An employee sees only their own record in full - their skills, their
/// progression and their rating history. The filter lands on Employee and
/// propagates through the relationships to Employee Skill and Skill Assessment.
///
/// Assign the Skills-Employees Entra security group to this role.
role 'Employee Self'
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission Employee = 'Employee'[Email] = LOWER ( USERPRINCIPALNAME () )
